                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of putting a series of three or more options strikes into the stock market."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b97b6390-90ad-45f8-8d51-e8f3f8639a2a",
                                                "sense_id": "b3980d70-2c18-322c-a630-7363a96b42ed",
                                                "text": "As a practical matter, you cannot put on these positions simultaneously at reasonable prices. In order to achieve these positions at a reasonable risk/reward profile, you must put the positions in a series of separate trades. This process is called legging."
                                            }
